  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx + y = 12\n\nx - y = 4\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nx³ + y³ = (x + y)³ - 3xy(x + y)\n\nxy = ((x + y)² - (x - y)²)/(4)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ xy = (12² - 4²)/(4) = (144 - 16)/(4) = (128)/(4) = 32\n\n⇒ x³ + y³ = 12³ - 3 × 32 × 12 = 1728 - 1152 = 576\n\n⇒ (x³ + y³)/(x + y) = (576)/(12) = 48\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 48.**\n\nf7",
